## 11. Future work not included

Not included in this branch:

```text
real executeAction() implementation
service invocation
backend adapter execution
native worker backend behavior wiring
scheduler lane work
runtime public API expansion
memory/storage backend work
multimodal/vision execution
Cognitive Graph Runtime implementation
cleanup or optimization pass
```

Recommended next branch family:

```text
runtime-backend-adapter-execution-interface-v1
```

Reason:

```text
The executor skeleton now defines the handoff point. A future executor still needs a typed backend adapter execution interface before real executeAction() behavior or native worker backend wiring can be safely implemented.
```
